[h2]The uber and boss chests pay like uber chests again[/h2]
[list]
[*]Every hand built uber and boss hoard chest was quietly repointed at a generic base game chest table a long way back, so the rich tables written for those chests sat unused. Twenty one of the thirty uber chests were paying ordinary Cyclops grade loot, and eighteen of their own loot tables were referenced by nothing at all. Every one of them now opens its OWN table again, at the volume it was written with, and no uber chest is left on base game loot.
[*]That single miswiring is what was behind the Great Hall of Propontis chest paying two items, the chest guarded by Tantalus, the Dread Halls hoard and the Obsidian Hoards all feeling gutted. One cause, found and fixed once, across all ten chest families rather than the four that were noticed.
[*]The Great Hall of Propontis chest never had a loot table of its own: it was a copy of the Obsidian Hoard chest and shared that chest records. It now has its own family of tables, so the two can be tuned apart.
[*]The Epic and Legendary Obsidian Hoards were guaranteeing a Normal tier relic. Each difficulty now guarantees a relic of its own tier.
[*]The gift boxes in the secret places drop three times as many items.
[/list]

[i]Wiring and item count only. No new items, no new monsters, no map changes, and what each table can pay is unchanged. The blood cave hidden stash is untouched and still pays the most of any chest in the mod.[/i]

